---
/** Home: how a model learns, in three small line drawings. */
import Icon from '@/components/layout/Icon.astro';
---
<ol class="how-grid">
  <li class="how-card" data-reveal>
    <div class="how-art" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="ex-grid">
        <span class="ex"><Icon name="cat" size={22} strokeWidth={1.5} /><small>고양이</small></span>
        <span class="ex"><Icon name="dog" size={22} strokeWidth={1.5} /><small>강아지</small></span>
        <span class="ex"><Icon name="dog" size={22} strokeWidth={1.5} /><small>강아지</small></span>
        <span class="ex"><Icon name="cat" size={22} strokeWidth={1.5} /><small>고양이</small></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <span class="how-step">01</span>
    <h3>정답이 달린 예시를 보여 줘요</h3>
    <p>"이건 고양이, 이건 강아지"처럼 정답이 붙은 예시를 아주 많이 보여 줍니다. 규칙은 알려 주지 않아요.</p>
  </li>
  <li class="how-card" data-reveal>
    <div class="how-art" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg class="loss" viewBox="0 0 200 92">
        <line x1="16" y1="80" x2="192" y2="80" class="axis" />
        <line x1="16" y1="8" x2="16" y2="80" class="axis" />
        <path d="M18 14 C 48 22, 58 56, 92 64 S 150 74, 190 75" class="curve" />
        <circle cx="92" cy="64" r="3.5" class="dot" />
        <text x="22" y="16" class="lbl">오차</text>
        <text x="190" y="90" class="lbl" text-anchor="end">반복</text>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <span class="how-step">02</span>
    <h3>틀린 만큼 조금씩 고쳐요</h3>
    <p>맞혀 보고, 얼마나 틀렸는지 점수를 매긴 뒤, 그 점수가 줄어드는 쪽으로 모델을 조금 고칩니다. 이 과정을 수없이 반복해요.</p>
  </li>
  <li class="how-card" data-reveal>
    <div class="how-art" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="guess">
        <span class="guess-box"><Icon name="image" size={24} strokeWidth={1.5} /></span>
        <Icon name="arrow-right" size={18} class="guess-arrow" />
        <span class="guess-box is-answer"><Icon name="cat" size={24} strokeWidth={1.5} /><small>고양이</small></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <span class="how-step">03</span>
    <h3>처음 보는 것도 맞혀요</h3>
    <p>배운 규칙으로 한 번도 본 적 없는 사진까지 맞힙니다. 예시를 외운 것이 아니라 규칙을 배웠기 때문이에요.</p>
  </li>
</ol>

<style>
  .how-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .how-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 18px 20px 22px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .how-art {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    height: 112px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--bg-2);
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .how-step {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12.5px;
  }

  .how-card h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .how-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .ex-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, auto);
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .ex {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 8px 6px 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .ex small,
  .guess small {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }

  .loss {
    width: 82%;
    height: auto;
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .loss .axis {
    stroke: var(--border-strong);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .loss .curve {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--accent);
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }

  .loss .dot {
    fill: var(--accent-2);
  }

  .loss .lbl {
    fill: var(--text-3);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  .guess {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .guess-box {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 4px;
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .guess-box.is-answer {
    border-style: solid;
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .guess :global(.guess-arrow) {
    color: var(--text-3);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .how-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
